  "title": "LP GRS/NS 0.5° Elemental Abundance Special Products (15 km grid)",
  "description": "Elemental abundance maps (Th, Fe, H) at 0.5° bin size (~15 km), derived from LP gamma ray and neutron spectrometer data acquired during the low-altitude mission phase (January 1998 – July 1999). Th in ppm (GRS); Fe as FeO wt% (GRS); H in ppm (NS). Note: hydrogen abundances are not necessarily reliable in regions of high thorium and rare-earth element abundances (Maurice et al. 2001a).",
  "license": "proprietary",
